  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed use of the site as a vehicle breakdown/tyre-fitting centre is considered appropriate, as it would not compromise the functionality, sustainability or balance of the associated industrial estate and would contribute positively to the balance of employment generating uses within the borough.  It would not harm the appearance of the surrounding green belt or result in any adverse traffic related impacts and is therefore in accordance with policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) E.1.5 (Development involving the Loss of or Changes in Employment Uses) ENV-N.1.4 (Development near the Green Belt Boundary) T.1.4 (Car and Cycle Parking and Servicing Facilities for Developments) and T.4.1 (Traffic Implications of New Development) of The London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority."
